WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.650
Learn's page on automatic assignment
policies is the procedure.

2
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:07.687
A policy carries a membership
rule in the dynamic group syntax.

3
00:00:07.687 --> 00:00:12.363
Entitlement management creates assignments
for users who match, removes them

4
00:00:12.363 --> 00:00:16.613
for users who stop matching, and a grace
period can keep access for a while.

5
00:00:16.613 --> 00:00:19.766
Learn suggests one automatic
policy per package,

6
00:00:19.766 --> 00:00:24.149
warns that overlap can lose users
their access, caps a rule at fifteen

7
00:00:24.149 --> 00:00:28.763
thousand identities, and needs the
Identity Governance Administrator.

8
00:00:28.763 --> 00:00:31.035
And from November third, 2026,

9
00:00:31.035 --> 00:00:36.220
a policy using member-of is quarantined:
it stays, but does nothing.
